  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower 200 Girls to Save Them From Child Marriage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to train 150 vulnerable girls in market-targeted vocational skills such as computer training, baking, sewing, beadmaking, etc., and provide them with financial literacy and business management skills. The project will also provide financial support to beneficiaries in the form of seed grants and support 50 adolescent girls to return to and finish secondary education. The project&apos;s strategic goal is to create opportunities for girls, not spouses.</narrative>
  </description>
